{"id":30230,"mal_id":30230,"title":"Diamond no Ace: Second Season","englishTitle":"Ace of Diamond: Second Season","title_english":"Ace of Diamond: Second Season","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Daiya no Ace: Second Season","Ace of the Diamond: 2nd Season"],"en":"Ace of Diamond: Second Season","ja":"ダイヤのA[エース]～Second Season～"},"synopsis":"After the National Tournament, the Seidou High baseball team moves forward with uncertainty as the Fall season quickly approaches. In an attempt to build a stronger team centered around their new captain, fresh faces join the starting roster for the very first time. Previous losses weigh heavily on the minds of the veteran players as they continue their rigorous training, preparing for what will inevitably be their toughest season yet.\n \nRivals both new and old stand in their path as Seidou once again climbs their way toward the top, one game at a time. Needed now more than ever before, Furuya and Eijun must be determined to pitch with all their skill and strength in order to lead their team to victory. And this time, one of these young pitchers may finally claim that coveted title: \"The Ace of Seidou.\"\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Después del Torneo Nacional, el equipo de béisbol de Seidou High avanza con incertidumbre a medida que se acerca rápidamente la temporada de otoño. En un intento por construir un equipo más fuerte centrado en su nuevo capitán, caras nuevas se unen a la plantilla inicial por primera vez. Las derrotas anteriores pesan mucho en la mente de los jugadores veteranos mientras continúan su riguroso entrenamiento, preparándose para la que inevitablemente será su temporada más dura hasta el momento.\n \nRivales nuevos y viejos se interponen en su camino mientras Seidou una vez más asciende hacia la cima, un juego a la vez. Furuya y Eijun, más necesarios que nunca, deben estar decididos a lanzar con toda su habilidad y fuerza para llevar a su equipo a la victoria. Y esta vez, uno de estos jóvenes lanzadores finalmente puede reclamar ese codiciado título: \"El As de Seidou\".\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1440,"average_episode_duration":1440,"startDate":"2015-04-06","start_date":"2015-04-06","endDate":"2016-03-28","end_date":"2016-03-28","season":"spring","year":2015,"start_season":{"year":2015,"season":"spring"},"episodes":51,"num_episodes":51,"score":8.31,"mean":8.31,"numListUsers":153669,"num_list_users":153669,"genres":[{"id":23,"name":"School"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"},{"id":30,"name":"Sports"},{"id":77,"name":"Team Sports"}],"studios":[{"id":10,"name":"Production I.G"},{"id":11,"name":"Madhouse"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/74398.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/74398l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/74398.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/74398l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/9/74398l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"monday","time":"18:00","day_of_the_week":"monday","start_time":"18:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"monday 18:00"},"rank":322,"popularity":1786,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":84375,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2015-03-02T06:03:11+00:00","updated_at":"2023-01-17T04:03:53+00:00","source":"manga","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":18689,"title":"Diamond no Ace","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/5/54235.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/5/54235l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"prequel","relation_type_formatted":"Prequel"},{"node":{"id":34349,"title":"Diamond no Ace: Second Season OVA","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myan